  "description": "<div>\r\n<p><strong>Busty Boob Tape,</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>a new inclusive brand targeting bustier women, is revolutionizing wardrobe options with the launch of their groundbreaking range of 8 skin tones. Designed to empower women of all shapes and sizes, the brand aims to provide a wide range of options that allow women to wear whatever they want without restriction.</p>\r\n<p>The fashion industry has long neglected the needs of bustier women, with limited options available in the market for outfits that really support heavier breasted women, meaning creative bra configurations or unsightly bra straps and bra backs showing. Busty Boob Tape is on a mission to change that by offering a wider, stronger boob tape that actually works, with a diverse range of 8 skin tones, ensuring that women can find the perfect match for their skin or outfit.<span>&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span>In addition to offering a wide range of skin tones, Busty Boob Tape has developed a wider and stronger tape to provide more support for heavier set and larger breasted women and this sets us apart from our competition.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We offer 30 Day Payment Terms and 10% Commission on sales</p>\r\n</div>",
